1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,993
What if everything around
you could become 3D?

2
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,810
Point at it, and it's rebuilt.

3
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,092
This is Mitsinjo Grid VR.

4
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,346
Let's go into the village, in VR.

5
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,051
We analyse the view.

6
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,852
We take the fridge.

7
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,778
The AI draws its views…

8
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:11,099
…and here it is, in 3D.

9
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,989
Now, let's go outside.

10
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:27,591
We analyse the street.

11
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:31,411
We take the car.

12
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:41,877
There it is, in 3D.

13
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:46,582
Into the village simulation.

14
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,165
Same headset, no loading.

15
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,216
Here we are.

16
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,436
A little walk around the village.

17
00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:13,844
Evening. I cut the power to the houses…

18
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:16,589
…the lights fade.

19
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:21,189
And back on.

20
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:30,595
The dispatcher's mixing desk.

21
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,182
The clinic? Never cut.

22
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,820
Back to the lab.

23
00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:44,730
Mitsinjo Grid VR. Point at the
world. Build it. Power it.
